Points to Remember: npx drizzle-kit push
Synchronizes schema → database
Updates the database to match your latest Drizzle schema definitions.
No migration files are created
Changes are applied directly to the database.
Good for development
Fast and convenient while building and testing locally.
Compares current schema with database
Detects differences and generates the necessary SQL automatically.
Executes changes immediately
Tables, columns, indexes, etc. are updated in the database right away.
Use caution in production
Teams often prefer migrations because they provide version history and better control.
Easy way to remember

push = Push schema changes directly to the database.








